From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:07:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: s8003: Give the display pipe the eDP
 transmitter window

The display pipe's driver trains the eDP link again after a sleep with the
panel off. Add the DisplayPort transmitter's registers (ADT displayport,
0x206700000, "displayport,s8003") to the pipe as its "dp" window. The
transmitter is in the dp power domain the pipe already holds.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Link: https://github.com/OrchardLinux/orchard/pull/231#issuecomment-7138590680
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003.dtsi | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003.dtsi
index f7c6c6f..08d053c 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s8003.dtsi
@@ -83,9 +83,10 @@
 		      <0x2 0x064c0000 0x0 0x8000>,
 		      <0x2 0x06500000 0x0 0x1c>,
 		      <0x2 0x06304000 0x0 0x4000>,
-		      <0x2 0x06300000 0x0 0x4000>;
+		      <0x2 0x06300000 0x0 0x4000>,
+		      <0x2 0x06700000 0x0 0x1000>;
 		reg-names = "adp", "disp-a", "disp-b", "disp-c", "disp-d",
-			    "side", "dart0", "dart1";
+			    "side", "dart0", "dart1", "dp";
 		interrupt-parent = <&aic>;
 		interrupts = <AIC_IRQ 140 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
 			     <AIC_IRQ 143 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
